## Introduction

Research software (especially in tier 3) needs to be provided by someone or some institution. This is a service role that differs from engineering efforts.

## Key responsabilities

- assure access to research software (hosting)
- organize requests, feedback and bug fixing
- organize community events to teach and train users
- install storage and compute to perform computational tasks
- maintaining a runtime environment, providing (graphical user and/or machine readable) interfaces 

## Challenges and solutions

Highlight common challenges faced by the role and how RSQKit can help overcome them.

- hardware limits to compute, RSQKit can show how to apply for compute time
- missing positions and personell in institutions for these tasks, RSQKit could hint on existing software as a service providers and on how to further develop your existing institution
